        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MM2009, Stainless Steel MM Series Robe Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis hook can be wall mounted in your bathroom to hold anything from hand towels to robes. It is available in a few modern finish options. It comes packaged with sturdy mounting hardware. But the bathroom isn't the only room that you can use this useful hook. Install some in your mudroom to hold jackets, purses, or backpacks. The modern style is a sure way to update any space. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana MM Series\"><b>Deltana MM Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the MM Bathroom or Kitchen Towel Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tip Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Tip Height: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Length: 2-3/16\" square</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MM2009-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262429\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana MM2009 Series Single Robe Hook Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 robe hook, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
